#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:5
msgid "Object layer level"
msgstr "对象层级别"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Overlapping of `elements`_ or `pictures`_ may occur at `workspace`_, "
"QElectroTech allows defining the level order from `elements`_ and "
"`pictures`_ at each `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"重叠 `元件 <elements_>`_ 或 `图片 <pictures_>`_ 可能发生在 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_，QElectroTech允许从 `元件 <elements_>`_ 和 `图片 <pictures_>`_ 每个 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_。"

