msgstr "使用键盘快捷键定义对象层"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:68
msgid ""
"As many other tools, QElectroTech is an applications which allows using "
"keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "与许多其他工具一样，QElectroTech是一种允许使用键盘快捷键的应用程序。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:71
msgid ""
